<title>UK: Swiss Bank Corp sets warrants on 2006 US Treasury.</title>
<headline>Swiss Bank Corp sets warrants on 2006 US Treasury.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 40 million American-style call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on the 6.50 percent U.S. Treasury bond due 2006, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	ISS PRICE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	  102.00	3.48 DEM	 2.99 PCT     44.63 X</p>
<p> CALL B	  104.00	2.41 DEM	 4.28 PCT     64.44 X</p>
<p> PUT C	    98.00	3.18 DEM	 5.25 PCT     48.84 X</p>
<p> PUT D	   100.00	4.55 DEM	 4.15 PCT     34.13 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 08.JAN.97-15.JAN.98   PAYDATE	07.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT/DDF		   MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> PRICES ARE ALSO AVAILABLE IN U.S. DOLLARS</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
